# Kit sources and scripts use LF. PowerShell entry scripts stay CRLF.
# Content identity for acceptance uses a newline-normalized digest
# (see lauren_team_kit.paths.newline_normalized_digest): CRLF and LF of the
# same text share that digest; the raw byte digest stays different.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
